OL,3,GNEWSAOne-hour queues on M62 after crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FDrivers are facing one-hour delays and
OL,6,Feight-mile queues on the M62 following
OL,7,Fa crash during the morning rush hour.
OL,9,FThe collision happened on the eastbound
OL,10,Fcarriageway between Junction 11 at
OL,11,FBirchwood, near Warrington, and
OL,12,FJunction 12 at the Eccles Interchange
OL,13,Fin Salford at about 06:35 BST.
OL,15,FGreater Manchester Police said it
OL,16,Fappeared to involve multiple vehicles,
OL,17,Fbut there had been no serious injuries
OL,18,For arrests.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
