OL,3,GNEWSAOne-hour queues on M62 after crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FNational Highways said one of the
OL,6,Fmotorway's four lanes remained closed
OL,7,Ffor vehicle recovery, although another
OL,8,Flane had reopened to allow traffic
OL,9,Fthrough.
